=You are the outline writer for Milo Story Studio.

Generate one structured children’s story outline from the approved concept below.

Use only the supplied concept information and the approved Milo canon context provided in the System message.
Do not invent new canon rules.
Keep Milo’s behavior age-appropriate for ages {{ $json.ageRange }}.
Target length: {{ $json.targetLengthMinutes }} minutes.

Approved concept:
Title: {{ $json.title }}
Premise: {{ $json.premise }}
Central problem: {{ $json.centralProblem }}
Emotional arc: {{ $json.emotionalArc }}
Theme: {{ $json.theme }}
Lesson: {{ $json.lesson }}
Setting: {{ $json.setting }}
Supporting characters: {{ $json.supportingCharacters }}

Return a complete outline containing:
opening
setup
incitingIncident
risingAction
climax
resolution
emotionalArc
lesson

Return only data matching the required structured output.

parameters.jsCode:
const concept = $json;
const story = $('Select Eligible Outline Story').first().json;
const canonVersion = String(story.canonVersion ?? '').trim();
const canonRef = String(story.canonRef ?? '').trim();
const storyValid = /^canon-v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+$/.test(canonVersion) && /^[0-9a-f]{40}$/i.test(canonRef);
const conceptVersion = String(concept.canonVersion ?? '').trim();
const conceptRef = String(concept.canonRef ?? '').trim();
const downstreamMatches = conceptVersion === canonVersion && conceptRef.toLowerCase() === canonRef.toLowerCase();
const canonLineageValid = storyValid && downstreamMatches;

return {
  json: {
    ...concept,
    canonVersion,
    canonRef,
    canonLineageValid,
    errorCode: !storyValid ? 'CANON_LINEAGE_INVALID' : (downstreamMatches ? '' : 'CANON_LINEAGE_MISMATCH'),
    message: !storyValid
      ? 'Authoritative Story canonVersion/canonRef is blank or invalid. Canon retrieval was not attempted.'
      : (downstreamMatches ? '' : 'Approved Concept canon lineage does not match the authoritative Story. Canon retrieval was not attempted.')
  }
};
